        {$sakazuki}: But for now... you won't change my mind. I've made my choice.
        {$name}: Yes, Sir...
        Fleet Admiral Sakazuki says nothing else. You stand back and watch as the Fleet Admiral finishes inspecting all the venus fly traps and places them in his cart.
With that debacle over, Fleet Admiral Sakazuki has to grab a few extra bags of specialty soil for his new mini collection of carnivorous plants. You don't know if any of them will survive, but the Fleet Admiral seems determined to give them the best chance possible.
Fleet Admiral Sakazuki gestures for you to pick the next location.
{$name}: Let's head to the next destination, Sir.
