(Total points: 3-5pts) //HOW DO??
That has been one heck of an evening. And here you thought today was just going to end up with you going home to take a relaxing shower to prepare for a very uneventful tomorrow.
Your stomach rumbles. Awww, you haven't gotten dinner yet. You are starving.
Fleet Admiral Sakazuki glances at you when he notices the sound. He's still walking side by side with you, but you know there's a junction coming up next and he'll have to take a different turn to go home. You remember the earlier events, the time you two spent together...
... And make a decision.
{$name}: Sir...
{$sakazuki}: Yes?
{$name}: Neither of us have had dinner yet. Do you want to... grab dinner together?
{$sakazuki}: ...
{$name}: It's fine if you say no, Sir! I just figured we are both hungry. And I heard the others say there's a good food stall just down the road.
{$sakazuki}: ...
{$sakazuki}: Alright. Let's head there. It's a bit late for me to be making dinner. I'll make an exception.
You mentally cheer. You didn't expect him to say yes. Hurrying after him, you two enter a humble stall. Time for dinner!
